abstract: >-
  Source, configurations, formal models, generated experimental evidence,
  recovery and receipt integration, matched baselines, replay and holdout,
  allocation replication and staged atomic settlement for AidMesh.
  Full bulk evidence is distributed in the associated GitHub Release assets.
  This citation does not assign the older source-only DOI to the new release.
